---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input whop.accounts.GetAccountFeesRequest
---@return whop.accounts.AccountFees? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_account_fees(input) end

---Retrieve Account Preferences
---
---Retrieves the account's preferences: a singleton settings document keyed by preference name.
---
---`GET /accounts/{account_id}/preferences`
